  filter(p_fdr_peak < 0.05, is.na(p_fdr_auci) | p_fdr_auci >= 0.05)
bfnes_index_dependent_text <- if (nrow(bfnes_index_dependent) == 0) NULL else
  paste(bfnes_index_dependent$Reactivity, collapse = ", ")
```




**Results.** Full peak-vs-AUCi head-to-head values for BFNES × all 13 reactivity outcomes are shown above. `r if (!is.null(bfnes_index_dependent_text)) paste0("The association", if (nrow(bfnes_index_dependent) != 1) "s" else "", " between BFNES and ", bfnes_index_dependent_text, " should be considered index-dependent: significant under peak-based reactivity but not under the AUCi-based sensitivity check.") else "No association that was significant under peak-based reactivity lost significance under the AUCi-based sensitivity check."`

